Letter {{l|sl|a}} with macron {{l|sl|̄|◌̄}} to signify presence of both pitches.

===Pronunciation===
* {{qualifier|phoneme}}: {{IPA|sl|/àː/}}, {{IPA|sl|/áː/}}

===Symbol===
{{head|sl|symbols}}

# {{qualifier|[[wikipedia:Slovene_national_phonetic_transcription|tonal SNPT]]}} ''[[phonetic|Phonetic]] [[transcription]] of sound ''[{{IPAlink|aː|ä}}] when it can bear either pitch.

====Usage notes====
Symbol is sometimes used as a letter to denote pitch in a word, but that is mostly limited to foreign or specialized dictionaries.

===See also===
