Page 233 ä: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
From {{der|sl|de|ä}}, with its corresponding pronunciation, which is still used by some speakers, however, the majority of speakers have vernacularized the pronunciation to a long close-mid vowel regardless of the initial pronunciation.

====Pronunciation 1====
* {{qualifier|phoneme}}: {{IPA|sl|/éː/|/èː/|[ɛ́ː]}}
* {{qualifier|letter name|common}}: {{sl-IPA|preglašéni ā}} ({{l|sl|preglašeni a}})
* {{qualifier|letter name|educated}}: {{sl-IPA|ē}}
* {{rhymes|sl|ɛː}}
* {{homophones|sl|e}}

=====Letter=====
{{head|sl|letter|lower case||upper case|Ä}}

# ''Additional letter in Slovene common mostly in loanwords from [[German]].''

=====Noun=====
{{sl-noun|ä|m-in}}

# {{q|educated}} {{n-g-lite|The name of the [[Appendix:Latin script|Latin script]] letter '''''[[Ä]]''''' / '''''[[ä]]'''''.}}

====Usage notes====
It is more common to use the name {{l|sl|preglašeni a}} than to use this name.

====Inflection====
* Overall more common
{{sl-decl-noun-m|ä|ä-j}}

* More common when with a definite adjective
{{sl-decl-noun-table2|ä|ä|ä|ä|ä|ä|ä|ä|ä|ä|ä|ä|ä|ä|ä|ä|ä|ä|title=Masculine inan., no endings}}

====Pronunciation 2====
* {{qualifier|sound}} {{IPA|sl|[æ]}}

=====Symbol=====
{{head-lite|sl|symbols|langname=Slovene}}

# {{qualifier|[[wikipedia:Slovene_national_phonetic_transcription|SNPT]]}} ''[[phonetic|Phonetic]] [[transcription]] of dialectal sound ''[{{IPAlink|æ}}].

===Etymology 2===
Letter {{l|sl|a}} with diaeresis ({{l|sl|¨}}) to signify [[centralization]].

====Pronunciation====
* {{qualifier|Resian}} {{IPA|sl|/ɐ/}}

====Letter====
{{head|sl|letter|lower case||upper case|Ä}}

# {{Latn-def|sl|letter|2|alphabet name=Resian}}

===See also===
* {{l|sl|a}}
* {{l|sl|à}}
* {{l|sl|á}}
* {{l|sl|ã}}
* {{l|sl|å}}
* {{l|sl|ā}}
* {{l|sl|ą}}
* {{l|sl|ȁ}}
* {{l|sl|ȃ}}
* {{l|sl|ȧ}}

===References===
* {{cite-book|sl|last=Kenda-Jež |first=Karmen |date=February 27, 2017 |title=Fonetična trankripcija |trans-title=Phonetic transcription |url=https://fran.si/150/sla-slovenski-lingvisticni-atlas-1/datoteke/SLA1_Foneticna-transkripcija.pdf |archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20220122221458/https://www.fran.si/150/sla-slovenski-lingvisticni-atlas-1/datoteke/SLA1_Foneticna-transkripcija.pdf |archivedate=January 22, 2022 |accessdate=March 19, 2022 |publisher=Znanstvenoraziskovalni center [[SAZU]], Inštitut za slovenski jezik Frana Ramovša |pages=27–30 }}
* {{cite-book|last=Steenwijk|first=Han|title=Ortografia resiana = Tö jošt rozajanskë pïsanjë|publisher=CLEUP|year=1994|location=Padua|worklang=it, sl}}

