Page 278 basati: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{der|sl|goh|fazzōn}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{sl-IPA|básati}}

===Verb===
{{sl-verb|básati|impf}}

# to [[stuff]], to [[cram]]
#: {{ux|sl|Sedel sem na klopci in opazoval, kako se ljudje '''bašejo''' v avtobus.|I sat on a bench and watched people '''cramming''' themselves on a bus.}}
# {{lb|sl|archaic}} to [[load]] (a gun)
#: {{synonyms|sl|nabíti}}
#* {{quote-book|sl|author=Simon Jenko|title=Vaje, 2. letnik|page=86|passage=Orožje v roko! — zdaj urno naprej, '''basali''' bomo puške, pod Pustimgradom.|translation=Grab some weapons! – Move quickly, we will '''load''' guns, under Pustimgrad.|year=1855}}
# to [[run out of|be running out of]]
#* {{quote-web|sl|url=https://www.blog.uporabnastran.si/2022/06/15/sof-2022-shift-je-agencija-leta-a1-slovenija-je-znamka-leta-mercator-je-oglasevalec-leta-velike-nagrade-so-prejele-kampanje-babica-lesnina-glavni-proti-jutru-burek-olimpija-in-nepricakovana/|title=Prenovljena trgovina Mercator na Gregorčičevi ulici v Ljubljani s širokim naborom pripravljenih izdelkov Minute za vse tiste, ki vas baše čas.|date=2018-12-5|accessdate=2023-02-06|work=Uporabna stran|passage=Prenovljena trgovina Mercator na Gregorčičevi ulici v Ljubljani s širokim naborom pripravljenih izdelkov Minute za vse tiste, ki vas '''baše''' čas|translation=The renewed Mercator store on Gregorčič street in Ljubljana with a wide variety of Minute ready-made products for all of those who are '''running out of''' time.}}
# {{lb|sl|colloquial}} to [[fool]]
#: {{ux|sl|Ne me '''basat'''!|No '''way'''!}}
# {{lb|sl|impersonal}} to be in [[distress]]{{sl-ref|SSKJ}}
# {{lb|sl|reflexive}} to [[gulp]]
#* {{quote-web|sl|url=https://www.dnevnik.si/1042533957|title=Na ravni zavesti smo slabši od živali|date=2012-6-5|author=Andraž Rožman|work=Dnevnik|passage=Ko sem zvečer prišel domov, sem se '''basal''' s čokolado in v tem utapljal živčnost.|translation=When I came home in the evening, I started '''gulping''' chocolate and drowning my anxiety.|accessdate=2023-02-06}}
# {{lb|sl|Upper Carniolan dialect}} to [[move]] {{gloss|change place of residence}}{{sl-ref|SSKJ}}

