#* {{quote-book|sl|author=Harriet Elisabeth Beecher-Stowe|title=Stric Tomaž ali življenje zamorcov v Ameriki|trans-title=Uncle Tomaž or life of black people in America|page=31|passage=Doteče ju pozno pri neki kovačnici, kjer je Halaj Tomaža še na rokah vkleniti dal, '''bavši''' se namreč čverstega zamorca.|translation=He catches up to them late by some blacksmith, where Halaj had Tomaž handcuffed as well, '''fearing''' the strong black man.|year=1853}}
