===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|sl|sla-pro|*biti}}, from {{inh|sl|ine-bsl-pro|*bī́ˀtei}}, from {{inh|sl|ine-pro|*bʰeyh₂-}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{sl-IPA|bíti}}
* {{hyphenation|sl|bí|ti}}

====Verb====
{{sl-verb|bíti|impf}}

# to [[beat]] {{gloss|to hit, to strike}}
#* {{quote-web|sl|url=https://kormeshka.ru/sl/zhena-udarila-muzha-chto-delat-sovety-psihologa-muzh-bet-zhenu-ili/|title=Žena je po nasvetu psihologa udarila svojega moža. Mož tepe svojo ženo, ali Pazite se sadista v hiši! Možni dejavniki tveganja za pojav agresije|date=2019-2-25|accessdate=2023-02-08|work=Kormeshka|passage=Če mož redno '''bije''' svojo ženo, potem morate najti način, kako ga ustaviti.|translation=If a man is regularly '''beating''' his wife, you have to find a way to stop him.}}
# to [[beat]] {{gloss|to hit repeatedly, but not necessarily in rhythm}}
#* {{quote-web|sl|url=https://sl.planeta-design.com/6637102-how-to-beautify-your-home-in-the-fall-and-feel-happy|title=KAKO JESENI POLEPŠATI SVOJ DOM IN SE POČUTITI SREČNEGA|accessdate=2023-02-08|work=Planet design|passage=Dajmo torej nekaj predlogov, ki bodo hiši dali vitalnost , z majhnimi in velikimi okraski, ki lahko olepšajo in poskrbijo, da se počutimo vedno dejavne, tudi kadar zunaj dež '''bije''' po oknih.|translation=Let's therefore give some suggestions, which will give your house vitality, with small and big decorations, which can embellish and make sure that we feel active, even when the rain '''is beating''' on the windows.}}
# {{lb|sl|usually reflexive}} to [[fight]]
#* {{quote-web|sl|accessdate=2023-02-08|author=Ivica Flis Smaka|title=Dodajmo kakovost življenju|passage=In mi vsi nenehno '''bijemo''' bitko z zahrbtnim in neizprosnim sovražnikom, ki mu je ime staranje.|translation=And we all are constantly '''fighting''' a battle with a treacherous and unrelenting enemy, which is called ageing.|year=2023|url=https://dr-flis.si/dodajmo-kakovost-%C5%BEivljenju}}
# to [[strike]]
#: {{uxi|sl|Ura je '''bila''' tri četrt.|The clock was '''striking''' quarter to [some full hour].}}
# {{lb|sl|impersonal}} ''Used to tell time''{{sl-ref|SSKJ}}
#: {{uxi|sl|Osem je '''bilo'''.|It '''was''' eight '''o'clock'''.}}
# {{lb|sl|archaic}} to [[play]] an instrument
#* {{quote-book|sl|author=Janez Leon|title=Levretanske pridige|page=20|passage=In slišal sem glas od neba, kakor šum veliko vod, in kakor bobnenje velikega gromenja, in ta glas, katerega sem jaz slišal, je bil kakor citarjev, ki na svoje citre '''bijejo'''…|translation=And I heard the voice from the sky, like the sound of many rivers, and like a grumble of a big thunder, and this voice, which I have heard before, was like that from men which '''play''' their zithers.|year=1863|location=Klagenfurt|url=https://books.google.si/books?id=hQBALDRPjCUC&dq=%22citre+bijejo%22&hl=sl&source=gbs_navlinks_s}}
# {{lb|sl|literary}} to spread{{sl-ref|SSKJ}}
# {{lb|sl|reflexive}} to contadict{{sl-ref|SSKJ}}
# {{lb|sl|rare|archaic}} to [[drop]], to [[fall]]
#* {{quote-book|sl|title=Novice kmetijskin, rokodelnih in narodskih stvari,|chapter=Posnetek iz novih postav|page=434|passage=Na kogar '''bíje''' sum, da je storil hudodelstvo, na ktero je postavljena petletna ali še daljša ječa, tacega je treba bilo po sedaj veljavnem redu kazenske pravde zaprtega preiskovati in izpraševati; po novi postavi pa sme viša sodna gosposka tudi temu dovoliti, da ostane na svobodi ali ne zaprt, ako varščino dá ali pa poroka postavi, kakor je bilo gori zapovedano|translation=Onto whom '''falls''' the suspicion that he had done an evil deed, for which the penalty is five or more years, they had to be under the currently standing crime law inspected and questioned locked up; the new law stipulates that the higher-ranked judge can allow them to stay free and not locked up as well if he puts up the bail or the jury's opinion is what is mentioned above.|year=1862|location=Ljubljana|url=https://books.google.si/books?id=uoZEAAAAIAAJ&printsec=frontcover&hl=sl&source=gbs_ge_summary_r&cad=0#v=onepage&q&f=false|series=20}}

