Page 506 brati: -------- begin text --------
{{was fwotd|sl|2023|March|10}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|sl|sla-pro|*bьrati||to pick up, to take}}, from {{inh|sl|ine-pro|*bʰéreti}}. For the meaning development compare with {{m+|la|lego||to choose, to select, to collect, to gather, to read}}, also compare with {{cog|ru|разобра́ть||to dismantle, to disassemble, to take apart, to deconstruct, to analyse, to parse, but also to recognize, to discern, make out, to read}}, {{m+|ru|[[разбо́рчивый]] по́черк||[[legible]] handwriting}}, {{m+|ru|[[разбо́рчивая]] речь||[[intelligible]] speech}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{sl-IPA|bráti}}
* {{hyphenation|sl|brá|ti}}

===Verb===
{{sl-verb|bráti|impf}}

# {{lb|sl|transitive}} to [[read]] (look at and interpret letters or other information)
#: {{syn|sl|čītati|prebīrati|razbīrati}}
# {{lb|sl|transitive}} to [[recognize]] feelings from a [[face]]{{sl-ref|SSKJ}}
# {{lb|sl|transitive|rare}} to [[guess]], to [[tell]] ([[fortune]]){{sl-ref|SSKJ}}
#: {{syn|sl|ugībati|napovedováti}}
#* {{quote-book|sl|author=Milko Matičetov|title=Zverinice iz rezije|page=34|passage=Tedaj so ji zmerom morale dati kaj, ko jim je metala karte in '''brala''' srečo iz roke.|translation=At that time, they always had to give her something when she was putting down cards and '''telling''' their luck from their hands.|year=1973}}
# {{lb|sl|transitive|archaic|chiefly eastern dialects}} to [[gather]], to [[pick]]
#: {{syn|sl|nabīrati|tŕgati}}
#* {{quote-book|sl|author=Rado Radešček|title=Slovenske legende|page=62|passage=Prigodilo pa se je, da je nekoč na Šmarni gori '''brala''' jagode nedolžna deklica, po imenu Matjaževa Micka iz Zavrha.|translation=Once it happened that an innocent girl named Micka from Zavrh was '''picking''' strawberries on Šmarna gora.|year=1983}}
# {{lb|sl|transitive|usually in imperative mood}} to [[understand]] as{{sl-ref|SSKJ, SP}}
#: {{uxi|sl|Evropska ('''beri''': zahodna) kultura.|European ('''i.e.''' western) culture.}}
# {{lb|sl|intransitive|reflexive|slang}} to [[keep]] [[in touch]], usually by [[message]]s {{sl-ref|Sprotni}}
# {{lb|sl|obsolete}} to [[cost]], to [[consume]], to [[need]] {{sl-ref|Pleteršnik}}

