===Verb===
{{sl-verb|držáti|impf}}

# be [[true]]
#: {{uxi|sl|'''Drži'''!|It's '''true'''!}}
# {{lb|sl|transitive}} to [[hold]], [[grasp]]
# {{lb|sl|transitive}} to [[stick to]], [[abide by]], [[keep to]]
#: {{uxi|sl|Glej, da se '''držiš''' roka.|Mind to '''meet''' the deadline.}}
# {{lb|sl|transitive}} {{lb|sl|figurative}} to have a [[hold]] on, [[keep]] in check, [[control]]
#: {{uxi|sl|'''Držal ga je''' v šahu / pesti.|He was '''keeping''' him under his '''control'''.}}
# {{lb|sl|reflexive}} to be [[attached]] to, [[touch]]
#: {{uxi|sl|Hiša se '''drži''' hleva.|The house is '''attached to''' the barn.}}
# {{lb|sl|reflexive}} to [[stick]]
#: {{uxi|sl|Vedno se '''držim''' pravil.|I always '''stick''' to the rules.}}
#: {{uxi|sl|'''Drži''' se ga kot klop.|She '''sticks to''' him like glue.}}
# {{lb|sl|reflexive}} to [[show]] feelings, [[grimace]] (usually negatively)
#: {{uxi|sl|Zakaj se tako grdo '''držiš'''?|Why are you '''grimacing''' like that?}}

