===Etymology 1===
Letter {{l|sl|E}} with grave ({{l|sl|̀|◌̀}}) to signify long stressed vowel.

====Pronunciation====
* {{qualifier|sound}}: {{IPA|sl|/ɛ́/}}
* {{qualifier|letter name}}: {{sl-IPA|krátki ẹ̄}} ({{l|sl|kratki e}})
