====Preposition====
{{sl-prep|-}}

# {{q|dialectal, particularly eastern dialects|with {{glossary|accusative}}}} [[into]], [[in]]
#* {{quote-web|sl|url=https://www.radio-odeon.com/ruzanc/dejo-pa-kdu-je-ta-branko/|title=Dejo: Pa kdu je ta Branko?|date=2020-7-24|work=Radio Odeon|passage=I ko ne vrjameš več v njega, on še skus vrjame '''f''' tebe.|translation=And when you don't believe in him anymore, he still believes '''in''' you.}}
# {{q|dialectal, particularly eastern dialects|with {{glossary|locative}}}} [[in]], [[at]]

=====Usage notes=====
This variant of preposition {{l|sl|v}} is used only before words that start with a devoiced consonant and binds to the syllable of the following word or geminates [{{IPAlink|f}}] if the following word starts with it.

