Page 1203 g: -------- begin text --------
{{wikipedia|lang=sl}}

===Etymology===
From Gaj's Latin alphabet {{m|sh|g}}, from {{der|sl|cs|-}} alphabet {{m|cs|g}}, from Latin {{m|la|g}}. Pronunciation as {{IPAchar|/ɡə/}} is initial Slovene (phoneme plus a fill vowel) and the second pronunciation is probably taken from {{der|sl|de|g}}.

