Page 1204 G: -------- begin text --------
{{wikipedia|lang=sl}}

===Etymology===
From Gaj's Latin alphabet {{m|sh|G}}, from {{der|sl|cs|-}} alphabet {{m|cs|G}}, from Latin {{m|la|G}}, from a modification of the {{der|sl|la|-}} letter {{m|la|C||ce}}, from the {{der|sl|ett|-}} letter {{m|ett|𐌂||ce}}, from the {{der|sl|grc|-}} letter {{m|grc|Γ||gamma}}, derived from the {{der|sl|phn|-}} letter {{m|phn|𐤂||giml}}, from the {{der|sl|egy|-}} hieroglyph {{m|egy|𓌙}}. Pronunciation as {{IPAchar|/ɡə/}} is initial Slovene (phoneme plus a fill vowel) and the second pronunciation is probably taken from {{der|sl|de|G}}.

