# {{lb|sl|reflexive-se}} to [[separate]]
#* {{quote-book|1=sl|year=2011|title=Osamosvojitev 1991: država in demokracija na Slovenskem v zgodovinskih razsežnostih|url=https://books.google.com.br/books?id=qS5_AbHjj_8C&pg=PA142&dq=se+lo%C4%8Dujeta&hl=sl&newbks=1&newbks_redir=0&source=gb_mobile_search&ovdme=1&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwifmPa82vWLAxUXErkGHeh4JfQQ6AF6BAgJEAM#v=onepage&q=se%20lo%C4%8Dujeta&f=false|publisher=Znanstvena založba Filozofske fakultete Univerze v Ljubljani|isbn=9789612374662|page=142|text=Torej, pravi Lenin, Marxa je razumel le tisti, ki meni, da je diktatura enega razreda neizogibna in potrebna tudi v celotnem zgodovinskem obdobju, ko '''se ločujeta''' kapitalizem in družba brez razredov, t.j. komunizem.|t=So, says Lenin, the only one who truly understood Marx is the one who believes that the dictatorship of one class is inevitable and necessary even throughout the entire historical period in which capitalism and a classless society, i.e., communism, '''separate'''.}}
# {{lb|sl|reflexive-se|literary}} to [[be]] [[different]], to [[differ]] {{+obj|sl|:od(gen)<from>}}
