#* {{quote-book|1=sl|year=2010|author=Aleš Završnik|title=Kriminaliteta in tehnologija: kako računalniki spreminjajo nadzor in zasebnost, ter kriminaliteto in kazenski pregon?|url=https://books.google.com.br/books?id=BJ1wdsAf3DMC&pg=PA123&dq=mobilnega&hl=sl&newbks=1&newbks_redir=0&source=gb_mobile_search&ovdme=1&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjptcnSyvWLAxWFAbkGHZ2JFQQQ6AF6BAgIEAM#v=onepage&q=mobilnega&f=false|publisher=Inštitut za kriminologijo pri Pravni fakulteti v Ljubljani|isbn=9789616503167|page=125|text=To je potrebno rešiti bodisi s Faradayevo kletko, vrečko ali pregrinjalom, ki ne prepuščajo signala '''mobilnega''' omrežja, ali pa z uporabo posebne forenzične kartice SIM, na katero se s pomočjo specializirane programske opreme vpiše IMSI in ICCID številki, na njej pa ni podatkov za povezavo v omrežje, zato do poškodovanja podatkov ne more priti.|t=This needs to be solved either by using a Faraday cage, bag or mat that does not let the '''mobile''' network signal through, or by using a special forensic SIM card, on which the IMSI and ICCID numbers are entered using specialised software, but which does not contain the data to connect to the network, so that the data cannot be corrupted.}}

