===Verb===
{{sl-verb|móči|impf}}

# [[can]], to [[be able]]

====Usage notes====
* Except in negative, conditional, past tense, future tense or clauses where "moči" is used as the only verb, the adverb "lahko" is used for ability:
 ''Lahko plavam.'': ''I can swim.''
 ''Mogel sem plavati.'': ''I was able to swim.''
 ''Bom mogel plavati.'': ''I will be able to swim.''
 ''Ne morem plavati.'': ''I can't swim.''
 ''Jaz bi plaval.'': ''I would swim.''
 ''Morem.'': ''I can''

