Page 2812 možgani: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|sl|moshgani}} {{q|Bohorič alphabet}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|sl|sla-pro|*mȍžžene}}.The word has undergone irregular change e → a, probably by analogy in {{l|sla-pro|*moždanъ}}.{{sl-ref|Snoj, 2015}} This caused gradual hardening of the consonant cluster to (žž → ždž → žg). The non-fully hardened form ({{l|sl|možjȃni}}) is obsolete or dialectal (Šavrin Hills dialect). In southeastern part of South White Carniolan dialect, the palatization still fully exists (moždž́ani). Cognates include {{cog|sh|mȍždāni}}, {{cog|sh|mȍžđāni}}, {{cog|pox|müzdin}} and {{cog|pox|müzdene}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{sl-IPA|možgȃni}}

===Noun===
{{sl-noun|možgȃni|m-p}}

# {{lb|sl|anatomy}} [[brain]]
# {{lb|sl|literary}} the most [[important]] people in an organization, [[leader]]s

