Page 3581 pot: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|sl|sla-pro|*pǫtь}}, from {{inh|sl|ine-bsl-pro|*pántis}}, from {{inh|sl|ine-pro|*póntoh₁s}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{sl-IPA|pọ́t}}
* {{rhymes|sl|oːt}}
* {{hyphenation|sl|pot}}

====Noun====
{{sl-noun|pọ́t|f|g2=m-in|g3=m-an}}

# {{lb|sl|inanimate}} [[way]], [[path]]
#: {{syn|sl|potka}}
# {{lb|sl|inanimate}} [[trip]], [[journey]]
#: {{syn|sl|potovanje|cestovanje|popotovanje|rajža|vandranje}}
#: {{uxi|sl|'''Pot''' je trajala več dni.|The '''trip''' lasted for multiple days.}}
# {{lb|sl|inanimate|physics}} [[distance]]
# {{lb|sl|inanimate}} [[way]] (method or manner)
#: {{syn|sl|način|postopek|pristop}}
# {{lb|sl|inanimate}} [[career]] (general course of action or conduct in life)
#: {{syn|sl|kariera}}
# {{lb|sl|animate|obsolete|only {{glossary|masculine}}}} [[messenger]]
#: {{syn|sl|brzotek|glasnik|kurir|sel|novičar|poročnik}}
# {{lb|sl|animate|historical|only {{glossary|masculine}}}} a [[mediator]] who buys things in other towns on demand
#: {{syn|sl|potovec}}
# {{lb|sl|inanimate|rare}} [[time]] (instance or occurrence)
#: {{syn|sl|bart|-krat}}

=====Usage notes=====
The masculine gender is nowadays obsolete, except in some collocations, e.g. {{l|sl|križev pot}}. For animate senses, however, is the only possible.

