# {{lb|sl|transitive}} to [[emphasize]] {{gl|to pronounce distinctly, with emphasis}}
#* {{quote-book|1=sl|year=2019|author=Varja Balžalorsky Antić|title=Lirski subjekt: rekonceptualizacija|url=https://books.google.com.br/books?id=jHCiDwAAQBAJ&pg=PA129&dq=poudari&hl=sl&newbks=1&newbks_redir=0&source=gb_mobile_search&ovdme=1&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjAueOhv-eLAxV_vJUCHQZeD-gQ6AF6BAgJEAM#v=onepage&q=poudari&f=false|publisher=Založba ZRC|isbn=9789610501534|page=129|text=Vendar ob tem Foucault '''poudari''' nekaj bistvenega: »Treba bi bilo precizirati, v katerem polju je subjekt subjekt, in subjekt česa je (želje, diskurza, ekonomskega procesa itd.). {{...}}|t=However, at the same time, Foucault '''emphasizes''' something essential: "It should be specified in which field the subject is the subject, and the subject of what it is (desire, discourse, economic process, etc.). {{...}}}}
# {{lb|sl|transitive}} to [[emphasize]] {{gl|to give the content of what was said, stated greater importance by speaking}}
# {{lb|sl|transitive}} to [[emphasize]] {{gl|to make more distinct, more noticeable}}

