# {{lb|sl|[[24-hour clock]]|feminine|in the plural}} [[six o'clock]] in the [[afternoon]]
#: {{syn|sl|osemnajsta|šesta|šest}}
# {{lb|sl|neuter|follows third declension|uncountable}} number [[seventeen]]
#: {{syn|sl|sedemnajstica|sedemnajstka}}

