===Etymology===
From {{inh|sl|sla-pro|*sъ(n)}}. Prefixed form of the preposition {{m|sl|z}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{sl-IPA|z-}}

===Prefix===
{{head|sl|prefix}}

# {{n-g|Forms perfective verbs with the following meanings:}}
## {{n-g|(no change in meaning)}}
##: {{prefixusex|sl|budīti|t1=to wake|zbudīti|t2=to wake}}
## [[away]], [[aside]], [[down]]
##: {{prefixusex|sl|téči|t1=to run|stéči|t2=to run away}}
## [[up]]
##: {{prefixusex|sl|lẹ́sti|t1=to climb|zlẹ́sti|t2=to climb up}}
## [[together]]
##: {{prefixusex|sl|varīti|t1=to weld|zvarīti|t2=to weld together}}

====Usage notes====
Before voiceless consonants, the variant {{m|sl|s-}} is used. Before the sibilants ''s'' or ''z'', the variant {{m|sl|se-}} is used.

